TRADING212_PAPER_PRICE_SEED_SYMBOLS=VOD,SHEL,BP,BARC,HSBA,LLOY,AZN,GSK,ULVR,REL,RIO,GLEN,BATS,DGE,NG,TSCO,RR,LSEG,BA,SGE
